Z||000000||Black88GT||01-29-2001||08:59 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://a1732.g.akamai.net/7/1732/121/0c53e795a1b054/cbsimages.cbsig.net/cbsstore/survivor2/gfx/logo_top.gif"> <P>Wow.  Even though I was drunk I still watched and remembered Survivor 2 last night.<BR>It was pretty cool so far, the competition was a little more extravagent then last years and the people seem more "sculpted" if that makes any sense (I also hate the tribal colors!).  Like last year had a bunch of different kinds of people, while this years has a couple old people, in general they are strong/good looking.  <BR>I am rooting for Jeff!  <P>I was a big fan of last years Survivor, I personally don't think there is any chance they will top that....<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||2
