Z||000003||BN Boomer||01-30-2001||05:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by loafer87gt:<BR><B>I'm rooting for the old farmer/carpenter guy Rodger. He probably has more practical knowledge than any other guy or gal there. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Like that has anything to do with who is the most capable so-called "survivor". Look for who is the craftiest and subtle but effectively manipulative, which is why that idiot won the original series, NOT because he could actually survive in a situation where he was alone and his continued existence depended upon his practical knowledge or outdoor skills. I don't know why they even call these ridiculous shows "reality". They might as well just go into an office or high school and document the ladder climbing, politicking, backstabbing, and popularity contests.<P><P>------------------<BR>Greg, aka Boomer<BR>Red 85 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.gmemd.com/locomotives/naf/images/sd70sm.gif"> ||||reg||13
