Z||000008||Black88GT||02-01-2001||11:30 AM||||It's actually a pretty good show.  It didn't really copy off any other shows, it was the original.  The media is the one that gave it the "reality TV" name badge.  It's really more of a game show.  I like to watch the competitions they have and its interesting to see who gets kicked off at the end.  I don't watch it to satisfy some voyeuristic (sp) craving like most opponents of the show want you to think.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">             <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
